// IntroString :
"P3961710122" "I am Old Father Time, and as this year comes to a close, I must pass my mantle onto the Baby New Year, so that time may continue to flow. But that scoundrel, the Red Cap Snaptooth, has kidnapped the Baby New Year, and plans to take him to the Fey lands! If that happens, time will grind to a halt. Heroic hopes and villainous plans, all will come to naught! <A HREF={ACCEPT}>So, I ask the mightiest of mortals, whether they be hero or villain, to help me and rescue Baby New Year!</A> <br><br>What's more, heroes and villains may work together on this mission, such is its grave import! "
// AcceptString :
"P3124848887" "Rescue Baby New Year from Snaptooth!"
// SendOffString :
"P4294550906" "You will have to fight your way through a cold and wintry realm. Snaptooth has gathered Tuatha, the Winter Horde, and other Red Caps to him. You will have to defeat the Winter Guard in order to open the icy caverns where Baby New Year is being held. Once you have him, bring him back to the fairy ring to make your escape. <br><br>And do not forget that heroes and villains may work together in this task!"
// ActiveTaskString :
"P3119352831" "Rescue Baby New Year"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P585897428" "Baby New Year is still a captive of Snaptooth! Perhaps you should find some more allies?"

